Package: discopop
Maintainer: Lukas Rothenberger <lukas.rothenberger@tu-darmstadt.de>
Depends: libc6, python3, python3-pip, python3-venv, python3-tk, build-essential, make, cmake, git, llvm-19-dev, clang-19, libomp-19-dev, libboost-all-dev
Architecture: all
Homepage: https://github.com/tuda-hpclab/discopop
Description: DiscoPoP is an open-source tool that helps software developers parallelize their programs with threads. It is a joint project of the Laboratory for Parallel Programming @ TU Darmstadt and the Software Analytics and Pervasive Parallelism Lab at Iowa State University.
 .
 GitHub: https://github.com/tuda-hpclab/discopop
